questions.explanation:
Evaluate the model at successive whole years. \[
\begin{aligned}
V(3)&=12000(0.8)^3 \\
&=12000(0.512) \\
&=6144
\end{aligned}
\], which is not less than \(6000\). \[
\begin{aligned}
V(4)&=12000(0.8)^4 \\
&=12000(0.4096) \\
&=4915.2
\end{aligned}
\], which is less than \(6000\). Therefore the value first falls below \(6000\text{ yuan}\) after \(4\) whole years.
